萌え袖.\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/01ps7twuxi9g", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b04b03f7/uploads/origins/e2bbaa18-a066-49c5-8805-2729aed1b8f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d34ae5d736d872c7d58e8fd9cac39df9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b04b03f7/uploads/origins/e2bbaa18-a066-49c5-8805-2729aed1b8f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d34ae5d736d872c7d58e8fd9cac39df9, https://si.imgix.net/b04b03f7/uploads/origins/e2bbaa18-a066-49c5-8805-2729aed1b8f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5bf2b84c9d420e735908348917f48144 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b04b03f7/uploads/origins/e2bbaa18-a066-49c5-8805-2729aed1b8f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf0d8eeb08c2a4939891f7fe437a198d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI fell in love at first sight with your wonderful illustration, which is very cute with a hint of dark in it.\nI would like to ask you to draw a prankster and shy girl named Sulkowski Morpho from the following URL if you would like.\nPlease feel free to change the clothes and composition of the illustration as you like.\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10JfY36vUYgblo6dve98IX-QBLKNxP4ux", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c9d92bf/uploads/origins/34c02c65-8357-42a4-9e3d-a129d1d0ead8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7a3f3f4350078d1350271a3c0e9ea5b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1c9d92bf/uploads/origins/34c02c65-8357-42a4-9e3d-a129d1d0ead8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7a3f3f4350078d1350271a3c0e9ea5b, https://si.imgix.net/1c9d92bf/uploads/origins/34c02c65-8357-42a4-9e3d-a129d1d0ead8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86a83f9c3dd472f2a2ef076fdac9ffdf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1c9d92bf/uploads/origins/34c02c65-8357-42a4-9e3d-a129d1d0ead8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85d1a0780cac60950dad284139d1c236 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I really like your artwork, it's so pretty! I would like to request an illustration of my original character if possible.\n\nShe is a gentle and wise noble girl who is chosen to be the wise angel long ago. Her symbol item is pine cone and she is loved by the nature and small animals. Her angel's halo and wings are magical items possible to take off.  This time I would like to ask for an illustration of her black side, named as \"9 B-side「黑松かさ」\" in the folder.  Her black side is a fallen “angel” who loses the magic halo and wings and uses technological power to fight for her own dream. The wings of 「黑松かさ」is fixed to the rope connected with her hair accessory.\n\nThere are no restrictions on pose or composition, feel free to draw anything you like!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/171NyE8qdnTqsCZO6s-CLWI-zH-vbtM_z?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/723fda0b/uploads/origins/81017aab-2660-457d-95f2-de914e3d3284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c694e6591509f76caa30ad89e5f35a9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/723fda0b/uploads/origins/81017aab-2660-457d-95f2-de914e3d3284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6c694e6591509f76caa30ad89e5f35a9, https://si.imgix.net/723fda0b/uploads/origins/81017aab-2660-457d-95f2-de914e3d3284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eeb4b5e3db06f3b9207b4af9d1812535 2x, https://si.imgix.net/723fda0b/uploads/origins/81017aab-2660-457d-95f2-de914e3d3284?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=14dac1c34b55e5882652cb0fe15b008d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/08e814a6/uploads/origins/10f3dfef-0692-48fd-bc74-1043b3bec603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=518c514cc7a1be05716f13310d5f83fa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/08e814a6/uploads/origins/10f3dfef-0692-48fd-bc74-1043b3bec603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=518c514cc7a1be05716f13310d5f83fa, https://si.imgix.net/08e814a6/uploads/origins/10f3dfef-0692-48fd-bc74-1043b3bec603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c134d65a230fd78cf86118923ccd681 2x, https://si.imgix.net/08e814a6/uploads/origins/10f3dfef-0692-48fd-bc74-1043b3bec603?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34543124df3460d809e3cf3821ecbb28 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再度すみません\nよろしければ自ｷｬﾗのｲﾗｽﾄをお願いいたします\nﾌｫﾙﾀﾞｰの中の祈祷師と手のひらｻｲｽﾞの紫のﾀｺを一緒にお願いしたいです\n\n難しい場合はｷｬﾝｾﾙしていただいて大丈夫です!!\n可能であればpsdと背景透過を頂きたいですﾎﾟｰｽﾞや構成、背景などについては全てお任せします。\n\n機会がございましたらよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G8Sji7V0aX5KHWilS3Uf-kggEEZtZMlS?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d1e02ead/uploads/origins/8a65283a-a6f6-417e-858a-a22df05e3e6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6340da332eeb718d962da90cc2b1fed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d1e02ead/uploads/origins/8a65283a-a6f6-417e-858a-a22df05e3e6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6340da332eeb718d962da90cc2b1fed, https://si.imgix.net/d1e02ead/uploads/origins/8a65283a-a6f6-417e-858a-a22df05e3e6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5bfaf0bf1ff7eab30a58432611cf4f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d1e02ead/uploads/origins/8a65283a-a6f6-417e-858a-a22df05e3e6f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6cf1640970eb55a2b495bf9345dc144 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n絵柄とy2kの雰囲気がとても魅力的で好きです…！\n\n私のOCをお願いしたいです。やんちゃでいたずらが大好きな男の子です。\nfas様のy2kの雰囲気が大好きなのでそれを意識して頂ければとても嬉しいのですが、fas様の描きやすいように描いて頂ければと思います！また、差し支えなければファイルはpsd形式で頂ければ幸いです…！\n\nご検討よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/19167335.no-104", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f704e899/uploads/origins/b7164fc0-33c5-4c58-8e6b-38cd67d1404b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69158e06a61023e528a22f5c1eec7321", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f704e899/uploads/origins/b7164fc0-33c5-4c58-8e6b-38cd67d1404b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69158e06a61023e528a22f5c1eec7321, https://si.imgix.net/f704e899/uploads/origins/b7164fc0-33c5-4c58-8e6b-38cd67d1404b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d363530de7a36c0f70882c530df283c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f704e899/uploads/origins/b7164fc0-33c5-4c58-8e6b-38cd67d1404b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea748606dd4af4611f6609801a9da108 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I really like your style of drawing! Can I request you draw my original characters?\n\nGui (black hair): No gender. A monster who has lived for a long time, but looks like a child. Cheerful and extroverted personality. \nLight (yellow hair): An elf boy who is relatively introverted, shy, and talks less. He has a gentle personality.\nThe two are roommates. Although they have opposite personalities, they are also good friends. G is always the stronger one, and the good-natured L is happy to cooperate with G's various ideas. \n\nPlease feel free to play, because I like the clothes you drew very much, so if possible, please draw the clothes you think are suitable.\n\nThank you very much for seeing this, please feel free to cancel if you think it is inappropriate!><\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_LbsjhwmvAFux08aQr382taE490HUn2r?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_salmonhatchery/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2db50a/uploads/origins/d30bf981-4480-4194-8db2-9bbb495cb618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8efd451b11ff1a2dd11ab0c8aa958291", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd2db50a/uploads/origins/d30bf981-4480-4194-8db2-9bbb495cb618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8efd451b11ff1a2dd11ab0c8aa958291, https://si.imgix.net/fd2db50a/uploads/origins/d30bf981-4480-4194-8db2-9bbb495cb618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7bbf8b43d3e3727c72e180b18c20833f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd2db50a/uploads/origins/d30bf981-4480-4194-8db2-9bbb495cb618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=04cc53b38d7b517691a976738ed91e22 3x", "genre":